From a247771539de0dae28d832a7345d737e6e759692 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DByte308 <69403407+DByte308@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:13:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Headset page: switch sound output and microphone for the
 session

New Audio group with two choices: Don't change, Headset (automatic), or any
output/microphone present now. On Start the chosen devices become the
system defaults; when the session ends (or Envision closes) the previous
defaults come back, unless they were changed by hand meanwhile.

Uses pactl, so it works with PulseAudio and with PipeWire's pulse server
on any desktop. Monitor sources are not listed; a stored device that is
not connected stays selectable. Settings: PIMAX_AUDIO_OUTPUT,
PIMAX_AUDIO_INPUT.
